VERDICT: approve
{"verdict":"approve","summary":"After re-reading set_height and repaint_history_tail, I do not find the alleged shrink-branch issue blocking: the changed clear span is deliberately limited to the rows that are repainted, while set_height separately clears the old viewport/newly vacated chrome area. The added regression helper is somewhat self-referential, but that is test-strength concern rather than a production correctness defect.","concede":["The new test clear_span_never_exceeds_draw_span_after_viewport_moves_down is not a very strong independent oracle because its clear-span and draw-span helpers currently mirror the same formula."],"maintain":["I maintain approval: repaint_history_tail must not clear rows above top when scrollback_committed clamps the drawable history tail, because those rows are outside the repaint span and set_height already clears the old viewport/vacated chrome rows before repainting."],"findings":[]}
